speakerId":3200,"speakerName":"Kujirai Momiji","textMapHash":3711048346,"text":"Although I'm not sure what the difference is, compared to ordinary Magical Crystal Ore, but since we have decided to do so, we should be more rigorous and follow the sailing log closely.","nextNodeIds":[726620110]},{"nodeId":726620110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3200,"speakerName":"Kujirai Momiji","textMapHash":1024223274,"text":"Speaking of which, there are a lot of dangerous monsters over at Araumi. Let's go to the Adventurers' Guild and put up a commission.","nextNodeIds":[726620111]},{"nodeId":726620111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2145992226,"text":"It's okay, I'll handle them.","nextNodeIds":[726620112]},{"nodeId":726620112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3200,"speakerName":"Kujirai Momiji","textMapHash":1997417226,"text":"Ah... Right, I forgot you are a powerful adventurer!","nextNodeIds":[726620113]},{"nodeId":726620113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3200,"speakerName":"Kujirai Momiji","textMapHash":2747355058,"text":"I'm so lucky to have your help, I'm counting on you!","nextNodeIds":[726620114]},{"nodeId":726620114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3200,"speakerName":"Kujirai Momiji","textMapHash":4150675018,"text":"I'll go back and get some bait-making tools, let's meet up later at the beach on the west of Araumi.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7266201,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["3200"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_G